       "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Drip Campaign Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a drip campaign in marketing?\", \"a\": \"In marketing, a drip campaign is a pre-written series of messages sent to one person over time, each timed from something they did, such as joining a list. Mailchimp's glossary puts it as automated marketing emails sent to people who take specific actions on your website. Drip campaign marketing works best when every message has one job and one link.\"}, {\"q\": \"How to create a drip campaign?\", \"a\": \"Create a drip campaign by settling the trigger first, then the emails and their send days, then the events that end it early. A drip campaign template can suggest timing, but the trigger and exits come from your own records. Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder'>AI automation builder</a> turns those parts, written as sentences, into a working sequence.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is a drip campaign?\", \"a\": \"A drip campaign is an automated series of messages that a person receives one at a time over days or weeks, starting after an action such as a signup. Wikipedia describes drip marketing as a strategy that sends, or drips, a pre-written set of messages over time. That pace is the whole drip campaign meaning: small messages on a schedule instead of one long one.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is an example of a drip campaign?\", \"a\": \"An abandoned cart sequence is a common example: a shopper who leaves items in the cart gets a reminder an hour later and another the next day. Other drip campaign examples are course onboarding emails and renewal prompts. Each message reaches one person on their own timeline, unlike <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder/social-media'>social media automation</a>, where one post reaches a whole audience.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is the best software for sending email drip campaigns?\", \"a\": \"The best software is the one that already holds your contacts and can start a sequence from the events you care about. For drip email campaigns, confirm it can trigger on your own data, end a sequence at the goal, and honor an unsubscribe across every sequence. When the trigger lives in your product data, Emergent builds the sequence on that data.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you create a real estate email drip campaign?\", \"a\": \"Create a real estate email drip campaign by splitting leads by source first, because a buyer from an open house and a seller asking for a home value need different emails. Send buyers new listings inside their price limit on a fixed weekday, and send sellers a monthly note on nearby sales. End either drip the moment the lead books a showing or asks for a listing appointment.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is a drip campaign in real estate?\", \"a\": \"In real estate, a drip campaign is a scheduled series of emails or texts that keeps an agent in touch with a lead before a showing or listing appointment. Agents run drip campaigns for leads not ready to talk yet. Once a lead replies or books, stop the drip and move the lead into the agent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder/sales'>sales automation</a>.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is a drip campaign in email marketing?\", \"a\": \"In email marketing, a drip campaign is a sequence that starts separately for each subscriber on the day they act, rather than a single send to the whole list. A newsletter reaches everyone on one morning. A drip email campaign reaches one subscriber on day 1, another on day 4, and checks each contact's record before every send to see whether an exit has fired.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you create an email drip campaign?\", \"a\": \"Create an email drip campaign by writing every email as a set before you schedule any of them. Give each one a single point and one link, then read the series in order to catch repeats. Keep email drip campaigns short at first and add messages once you see where people exit. Emergent can build the sequence from a prompt.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I create an SMS drip campaign?\", \"a\": \"Create an SMS drip campaign the same way as an email one, and get each person's consent to texts before the first message. Wikipedia notes that drip messages take the form of email, although other media can also be used. Collect the number and consent on a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder/campaign'>campaign landing page</a>; that signup then starts the drip marketing campaign.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
      }
     },
